{"id":557030,"shortDescription":"Avenger Bird is a platform side-scroller game with pixel-art graphics, but your hero isn't just a regular hero. You are playing a bird that can flap it's tiny wings to fly and glide for a limited distances. It's a retro inspired 16-bit era game with innovative and challenging fly/glide mechanic.","developers":["TiliaSoft"],"publishers":["Ultimate Games S.A."],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Cromos de Steam","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"5 ENE 2017","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1792149830","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557030/ss_22291d540c4b7ddfaa4786db53021ae43263e613.600x338.jpg?t=1792149830","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557030/ss_22291d540c4b7ddfaa4786db53021ae43263e613.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792149830"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557030/ss_80e04caf3c14dc979763f6fc73c61d5a4b537b7c.600x338.jpg?t=1792149830","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557030/ss_80e04caf3c14dc979763f6fc73c61d5a4b537b7c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792149830"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557030/ss_94c4b73f767fc00394b5ef674993f42cbdb84e29.600x338.jpg?t=1792149830","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557030/ss_94c4b73f767fc00394b5ef674993f42cbdb84e29.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792149830"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557030/ss_d27e08444b7f52ad92387a3a2fa4d386f88cac74.600x338.jpg?t=1792149830","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/557030/ss_d27e08444b7f52ad92387a3a2fa4d386f88cac74.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792149830"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/55703